# Harness v1
#
# Rule for this file: ignore by explicit extension, never by blanket wildcard
# under results/. Every number that appears in a claim is read from a named file
# there, and a pattern that silently swallows one is worse than a repository
# carrying a stray artefact.

# --- Python ---
.venv/
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
.pytest_cache/
.ruff_cache/
*.egg-info/

# --- mise ---
# Machine-local overrides. .mise.toml itself is tracked: it is the pin.
.mise.local.toml
mise.local.toml

# --- results ---
# JSON is tracked. Raw captures are not: a ten-minute stream at 114 kB/s is
# about 68 MB, and a Stage 2 campaign is far larger. They are retained on disk
# where a gate calls for it, and referenced by the JSON, not committed.
results/*.csv
results/*.bin
results/*.raw
results/raw/

# --- firmware, capture engine ---
firmware/capture/build/
firmware/capture/.pio/
firmware/capture/cmake-build-*/
*.uf2
*.elf
*.map

# --- firmware, DUT (ESP-IDF) ---
# sdkconfig is generated from sdkconfig.defaults, which is tracked and is where
# the pinned configuration actually lives.
firmware/dut/*/build/
firmware/dut/*/sdkconfig
firmware/dut/*/sdkconfig.old
firmware/dut/*/managed_components/
firmware/dut/*/dependencies.lock

# --- KiCad ---
# Project, schematic, layout and the fabrication outputs are tracked.
*-backups/
*.kicad_prl
*.kicad_sch-bak
*.kicad_pcb-bak
fp-info-cache
*.lck
~*.*

# --- OS and editor ---
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
.vscode/settings.json
.idea/
